lay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3278980/extras/9b0ab2a81a276c3d720acd08f0ae7b81.poster.avif?t=1752855533\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3278980/extras/9b0ab2a81a276c3d720acd08f0ae7b81.webm?t=1752855533\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3278980/extras/9b0ab2a81a276c3d720acd08f0ae7b81.mp4?t=1752855533\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create a vaccine</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3278980/extras/a6e742649bdf36dc9eea23ef9025e400.poster.avif?t=1752855533\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3278980/extras/a6e742649bdf36dc9eea23ef9025e400.webm?t=1752855533\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3278980/extras/a6e742649bdf36dc9eea23ef9025e400.mp4?t=1752855533\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >or make a potion (medicines)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3278980/extras/54d5e22f275a9e91247f37b0b2344d64.poster.avif?t=1752855533\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3278980/extras/54d5e22f275a9e91247f37b0b2344d64.webm?t=1752855533\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3278980/extras/54d5e22f275a9e91247f37b0b2344d64.mp4?t=1752855533\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can play as a potential budget holder or just for fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3278980/extras/9a2de9b9c2f78f8258b761b85833e278.poster.avif?t=1752855533\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3278980/extras/9a2de9b9c2f78f8258b761b85833e278.webm?t=1752855533\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3278980/extras/9a2de9b9c2f78f8258b761b85833e278.mp4?t=1752855533\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join Aayto on his journey and welcome to Hindmarchville.</p>",
